English word list
The file app/src/main/assets/lexicon.txt is derived from the English
frequency list in hermitdave/FrequencyWords (OpenSubtitles). It is stored
in the app as a plain word list. Words that this keyboard treats as
misspellings or text-speak were removed so they are not offered as valid
spellings.

Keyboard layout
Row widths, the symbol pages, and the long-press accent letters follow the
layout of https://github.com/amirisback/keyboard (Apache License 2.0).
Those layouts were rewritten for android.inputmethodservice.Keyboard.
No source files from that project are included.

Not included
PoliteType does not contain code, patches, or assets from Gboard,
PixelBoard, gboard-gifs-extended, or Keybee Keyboard.
